  "body": "### What happened?\n\nI asked Gemini CLI to organize my files within the folder it was running and it 'lost' all my files. See the full attached text file for the full powershell conversation.\n\n[gemini cli screw up.txt](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21372906/gemini.cli.screw.up.txt)\n\n### What did you expect to happen?\n\nI expected it to fail gracefully and not hallucinate 'losing' the files and causing an alarm.\n### Client information\n\n<details>\n\n```console\n$ gemini /about\n\n                                                                        │\n│ CLI Version              0.1.13                                        │\n│ Git Commit               412b78c5 (local modifications)                │\n│ Model                    gemini-2.5-pro                                │\n│ Sandbox                  no sandbox                                    │\n│ OS                       win32                                         │\n│ Auth Method              OAuth                  \n```\n\n</details>\n\n\n### Login information\n\nOauth\n\n### Anything else we need to know?\n\n_No response_",
